	<row id="msg_0470_T04PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Magnet Train go over 340 mph!\rIt go between Kanto and Johto in\nno time. My commute used to be a\fwhole day. Now it’s\fan hour. I still late.</language>
